omx-clap-host (0.22.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: omx-clap-core 0.22.0
  * host_verbs_check: a verb AWAITING names is held until a package declares
    it
  * Keep the verbs header in the host's sources, out of the installed core
    headers
  * Document the host verbs declaration and the contract package
  * Ship the contract directory files in a noarch omx-clap-core-contract
    package
  * Hold the host to its installed verb declarations, and every source to
    their macros
  * Name the declared verbs by their rendered macros, not plugin-hostd's
    protocol.h
  * Declare the host verbs in data/verbs.json, rendered once for both hosts
  * README, doc, packaging: we host CLAP and LV2, the adapter named as the
    mapping it is (#352)
  * docs: the LV2 matrix says what each host proves, plugin-hostd's column
    what its tests run (#352)

